Error [E0120]: `value` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> scrub_removes_only_its_named_tag.jet:5:43
    |
  5 | fn redact(value: #PII String) -> String { value }
    |                                           ^^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Return a copy: `return value.copy()` — or take ownership with the move marker `^`: `value: ^#PII String`. To return borrowed data, declare `-> View<T> from value` and return a view derived from `value`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120

Error [E1004]: `core.process` has no item `run`
  --> scrub_removes_only_its_named_tag.jet:8:13
    |
  8 |     process.run(["echo", value]) ?? return Err("test")
    |             ^^^
 Why: Standard library modules expose a fixed set of public items
 Fix: Use one of: ProcessSignal, args, argv, check, cmd, current_pid, cwd, env, env_get, exit, on_signal, pipeline, run_spec, status_ok, stdin_text, which, Completed, ProcessReceipt, ProcessSpec, arg, args_extend, call, capture, check_call, check_output, combined_output, env_get_or, env_keys, env_set, env_truthy, failed, getoutput, getstatusoutput, list2cmdline, shell, signal_number, stderr_lines, stdout_lines, exited
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1004

Error [E0721]: A `Input` value is denied at `process.run`
  --> tests/ui/taint/scrub_removes_only_its_named_tag.jet:8:13
    |
  8 |     process.run(["echo", value]) ?? return Err("test")
    |             ^^^
 Why: The declaration for `Input` denies `Exec`, which covers this destination
 Fix: Remove the destination use, or pass the value through a matching `#Scrub(Input)` function
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0721
